  "description": "Ride all roads\n\nThe Warakin redefines the all-road category. Where traditional all-road bikes have tire clearance up to 700c x 40mm, the Warakin takes it up to 700c x 50mm. If a bike is truly meant to ride all roads, it needs to fit the tires to allow you to ride confidently, with comfort, and as fast (or slow) as you'd like.\n\nDETAILs, Details\n\nA bike that can hold its own for all-road, gravel, commuting, and overnighters needs to have the right features for consistent performance, without being *too* specialized. The Warakin has healthy tire clearance, adjustable geometry, and mounts for bottles, cargo, racks, and fenders.",
